POST / -> 405 (Allow: GET, HEAD)
Host: attacker.example (GET /docs/build-manifest.json) -> 200   (no Host allow-list)
Symlink test: a symlink docs/w3symlinktest.txt -> /etc/hostname created ONLY in the private copy -> 200 (readFile follows symlinks; containment check is lexical). Symlink removed afterwards. No symlinks exist in the committed docs/, packages/core/tokens/ or release/.
Response headers on HTML: Content-Type text/html; charset=utf-8, X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, Referrer-Policy: no-referrer, Cache-Control: no-cache. Absent: Content-Security-Policy, frame-ancestors/X-Frame-Options, Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy.
